        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryo izooba ndyaha Googi ah'okuziikwa omuri Israeli, omu ruhita rw'abahinguzi aha bukiizi bw'enyanja bw'oburugwa-izooba; okwo niyo bariziika Googi n'enyanja y'abantu be boona, omuhanda gw'abagyenzi gukafa; kandi haryayetwa Oruhita rwa hamoni-googi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ab'enju ya Israeli baryamara ameezi mushanju nibabaziika, babone kushemeza ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 28:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baryabaziika; kandi aha izooba eri ndihimbisizibwaho, kiryabahaisa ekitiinisa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima baryatoorana abantu b'okuguma nibaraba omu nsi nibaziika emitumbi eriba etsigaire omu nsi, ngu ensi eshemere; ago meezi mushanju ku garihwaho barysherura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo basheruzi ku bariraba omu nsi, omwe omuribo yaagwa aha igufa ry'omuntu, aryarita akamanyiso aha rubaju, okuhitsya obu abaziiki baririziika omu ruhanga rwa Hamoni-googi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kandi aho niho hariba orurembo orurikwetwa Hamona). Okwo nikwo barishemza egyo nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
