              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Gambira amahungu g'emiringo yoona n'enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa oti: Muteerane, murugye embaju zoona, mwije aha bugyenyi bw'ebitambo obu ndikubatebeekanisiza, obugyenyi bukuru bw'ebitambo aha bibungo bya Israeli, murye enyama kandi munywe eshagama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
