        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima ndyata ekitiinisa kyangye ahagati y'amahanga, amahanga goona gareebe ekifubiro eki mbahaire, ekirugire omu rubanja oru ncwire, gareebe n'omukono gwangye ogu mbabangiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
