            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi amahanga garyamanya ku ab'enju ya Israeli baatwairwe bari enkwatwa nibaturwa eby'okushiisha byabo, ahabw'okuba bakancumuraho, kyandeetera kubaihaho amaisho, n'okubahayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo; boona baitwa rurara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
