        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Mbwenu niinyija kugarura aba Yakobo abaatwairwe bari enkwatwa, ngirire embabazi enju ya Israeli yoona ahabw'okusaasibwa eiziina ryangye eririkwera. ",
          "type": "text",
